"""Original implementation. No code from the supplied reference plugin.
Settings are applied only after Apply & Continue to an idle stock U1.
Heads settings and filament feed are changed only by explicit user actions.
No uploads, print-start calls, AFC, profile-file scraping or startup connections.
"""
